<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<databaseChangeLog
        xmlns="http://www.liquibase.org/xml/ns/dbchangelog"
        xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance"
        xsi:schemaLocation="http://www.liquibase.org/xml/ns/dbchangelog
                            http://www.liquibase.org/xml/ns/dbchangelog/dbchangelog-4.31.xsd">

    <!--
        Framework module changelog: INCLUDES ONLY.

        Greenfield baseline. Each line below pulls a per-module MASTER changelog that ships as a classpath-root
        resource inside the corresponding pangaea / expression-kit dependency jar (resolved from the classpath, NOT
        relativeToChangelogFile — these are cross-jar `db/changelog/db.changelog-<module>.xml` resources). Every
        module master is self-contained: it owns the EXPLICIT, ordered includes of its own formatted-SQL leaves
        (relativeToChangelogFile inside the jar), so this file only orders the modules.

        Order = framework-infrastructure-first:
          1. persistence  : ShedLock coordination table (single canonical owner) + dead-letter message store.
                            ShedLock MUST precede workflow (workflow reuses this one shedlock table).
          2. inbox        : transactional inbox (idempotent consume).
          3. audit        : command_audit.
          4. reconciliation: reconciliation_discrepancy (Nova<->FCB recon state).
          5. workflow     : workflow_run / workflow_compensation / workflow_resume_key (durable orchestration).
          6. expression-kit: formula_definitions.

        The old nova framework leaves (the saga drop/cleanup 005/006 and the per-version shedlock/dead-letter/
        workflow/audit copies that referenced now-deleted pangaea paths) are GONE: this is a fresh baseline that
        never creates the retired saga_* tables, so there is nothing to drop or delete-from on an empty DB.
    -->

    <include file="db/changelog/db.changelog-persistence.xml"/>
    <include file="db/changelog/db.changelog-inbox.xml"/>
    <include file="db/changelog/db.changelog-audit.xml"/>
    <include file="db/changelog/db.changelog-reconciliation.xml"/>
    <include file="db/changelog/db.changelog-workflow.xml"/>
    <include file="db/changelog/db.changelog-expression-kit.xml"/>

</databaseChangeLog>
